WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
So many people are going through challenging times right now and it's really crucial that we develop the human skillset that enables us to be present with another person.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
So firstly, what we always want to do is acknowledge their feelings.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Simply feeling seen, de-escalates the intensity of the situation.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Number two is reassure the person that their feelings are valid.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A lot of times we get hung up on this, we think that by saying to someone,

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
your feelings are valid, that we are agreeing with everything that they are saying.

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
But no, we are just saying your experience is this and your feelings are valid and I see that.

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
And number three is to help them feel valued.

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.000
When we do this, when we offer someone presence, whether we are a leader or a manager, a colleague or a parent,

10
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:05.000
when we offer presence, we help the person feel grounded in the situation and to develop a sense of wholeness and agency as they move forward.
